              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is the Blitz a curved treadmill?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Yes. It is a self-powered curved treadmill with a 17-degree curve, which Bells of Steel describes as steep. Lean forward and the belt speeds up; drift back and it slows. Its six-level magnetic brake adds resistance on top.
              </p>
